# Traefik + ACME docker stack

## Initialize Smallstep Online CA
``` bash
docker pull smallstep/step-cli:0.30.6
docker volume create step-ca-data

docker run -it --rm --name step-ca-init \
  -v step-ca-data:/home/step \
  -v ./config/certs:/tmp \
  smallstep/step-cli:0.30.6 \
    step ca init \
      --deployment-type=standalone \
      --name="playground Smallstep Online CA" \
      --dns="step-ca,localhost,127.0.0.1" \
      --address=":9000" \
      --provisioner="me" \
      --acme \
      --root=<root_ca.crt> \
      --key=<root_ca.key>
```

``` bash
docker run -it --rm \
  -v step-ca-data:/home/step \
  alpine \
    sh -c 'echo <password> > /home/step/secrets/password && \
      chown 1000:1000 /home/step/secrets/password && chmod 600 /home/step/secrets/password'
```